{"seq":2,"slug":"balance-dynamic-stability","title":"平衡与动态稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/balance-dynamic-stability","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"平衡与动态稳定\">平衡与动态稳定</h1><p>一个人单脚站立时身体会不停微调，闭眼后更明显——平衡不是&quot;站住不动&quot;，而是持续把要倒下的趋势纠回来。腿足机器人面对同样的物理：重心高、支撑面小、随时可能倾覆。本篇专讲<strong>判断平衡的判据与维持平衡的原理</strong>：什么量越界意味着即将摔倒，靠什么模型预测并提前补救。这些判据是上一篇 <a href=\"leg-mechanisms-gait\">腿足机构与步态</a> 中&quot;动态步态需连续平衡兜底&quot;的具体兑现，而把判据变成关节指令则是 <a href=\"biped-quadruped-control\">双足与四足控制</a> 与 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 的任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>平衡判据回答一个问题：当前状态会不会导致不可挽回的倾覆。最基础的是<strong>支撑多边形</strong>——所有着地点围成的凸多边形。静态平衡要求重心（CoM）的地面投影落在支撑多边形内；一旦动起来，惯性力参与进来，单看重心投影就不够了，需要引入考虑动力学的判据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[平衡判据] --&gt; B[静态: 重心投影 ∈ 支撑多边形]&#10;  A --&gt; C[动态]&#10;  C --&gt; D[ZMP&lt;br/&gt;压力中心是否在支撑区内]&#10;  C --&gt; E[捕获点 Capture Point&lt;br/&gt;一步能否止住]&#10;  D --&gt; F[简化模型: LIP / 倒立摆]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[输出: 安全 / 需调整落足或动量]\">flowchart TD\n  A[平衡判据] --&gt; B[静态: 重心投影 ∈ 支撑多边形]\n  A --&gt; C[动态]\n  C --&gt; D[ZMP&lt;br/&gt;压力中心是否在支撑区内]\n  C --&gt; E[捕获点 Capture Point&lt;br/&gt;一步能否止住]\n  D --&gt; F[简化模型: LIP / 倒立摆]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[输出: 安全 / 需调整落足或动量]</pre><p>下表对比三类常用判据的适用范围与代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>是否考虑动力学</th>\n<th>适用步态</th>\n<th>计算代价</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重心投影</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>静态步态</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高速时失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零力矩点 ZMP</td>\n<td>是（无腾空）</td>\n<td>双足平地行走</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不支持腾空相</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捕获点</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>双足、推扰恢复</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>依赖简化模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全模型动量判据</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>任意含腾空</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需在线优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"零力矩点-双足平衡的经典标尺\">零力矩点：双足平衡的经典标尺</h2><p>**零力矩点（ZMP, Zero-Moment Point）**是双足行走最经典的判据。它定义为地面上的一点，在该点处地面反力的水平力矩为零。直觉是：脚掌能施加的反力被局限在脚底接触区内，若维持当前运动所需的 ZMP 落在脚底支撑区内，脚就能&quot;压住&quot;身体不翻转；一旦 ZMP 跑到脚边缘之外，脚会绕边缘翻起，机器人开始倾覆。</p>\n<p>ZMP 的水平位置可由重心运动反推。以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 方向为例，在重力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 与重心高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>zmp</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>g</mi></mfrac><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{\\text{zmp}} = x_c - \\frac{z_c}{g}\\ddot{x}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">zmp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条关系把&quot;重心加速度&quot;与&quot;压力中心位置&quot;直接挂钩——想把 ZMP 拉回脚内，就得调整重心的加速度。早期 ASIMO 一类双足正是靠预先规划满足 ZMP 约束的重心轨迹实现平稳行走。它的根本局限是假设至少一脚平踏在地、无腾空相，因此不适用于奔跑、跳跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线性倒立摆与捕获点\">线性倒立摆与捕获点</h2><p>要预测和恢复平衡，需要一个足够简单又抓住本质的模型。**线性倒立摆模型（LIP, Linear Inverted Pendulum）**把整机抽象成一根质量集中在重心、以恒定高度运动的倒立摆，得到优雅的线性动力学：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>foot</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{x}_c = \\frac{g}{z_c}\\,(x_c - x_{\\text{foot}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">foot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega = \\sqrt{g/z_c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是这个系统的特征频率。基于 LIP，研究者提出<strong>捕获点（Capture Point，又称 DCM 即发散分量）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>ω</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi = x_c + \\frac{\\dot{x}_c}{\\omega}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0309em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3449em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>捕获点的物理含义极其有用——若把脚正好落在当前捕获点上，倒立摆就会渐近停下，身体被&quot;接住&quot;。于是平衡恢复变成一个可计算的落足目标：受到推扰后，估计新的捕获点、把脚迈过去。这就是为什么人被推一把会下意识跨一步，跨在哪、跨多远都有据可依。捕获点把抽象的&quot;会不会倒&quot;转成具体的&quot;该把脚放哪&quot;，直接喂给落足规划（参见 <a href=\"leg-mechanisms-gait\">腿足机构与步态</a> 的 Raibert 法则）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从简化模型到全身动量\">从简化模型到全身动量</h2><p>LIP 与 ZMP 的威力在于简单，但它们丢掉了手臂摆动、躯干转动、腾空相这些真实自由度。现代腿足平衡转向<strong>全身动量</strong>视角：身体的线动量与角动量如何变化由地面接触力决定，而接触力受摩擦锥约束（不能拉地、不能超过摩擦极限滑动）。这把平衡从&quot;一个点的判据&quot;升级为&quot;在接触力可行域内规划动量轨迹&quot;，奔跑、跳跃、单腿落地这些含腾空相的动作才有了统一描述。</p>\n<p>这条升级路径正是后续控制章节的主线：<a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 在预测时域内滚动优化满足接触约束的动量与力，<a href=\"../control/force-compliant-locomotion\">力控与柔顺运动</a> 负责让关节真正输出这些接触力，而 <a href=\"../control/learning-locomotion\">学习驱动运动控制</a> 则用强化学习直接学出在复杂扰动下维持平衡的策略，绕开了对精确简化模型的依赖。平衡判据是这一切的评价标尺：无论用模型还是用学习，最终都要让机器人不越过倾覆的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判据选择的常见反模式\">判据选择的常见反模式</h2><p>判据不是越复杂越好，用错判据往往比不用更危险。下表列出几种典型误用及其后果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高速下仍只看重心投影</td>\n<td>惯性力未计入</td>\n<td>误判为稳定，实际已倾覆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用 ZMP 约束含腾空的步态</td>\n<td>强行要求压力中心落在脚底</td>\n<td>无法起跳，动作被过度保守化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把捕获点当精确落足目标</td>\n<td>忽略摆腿时间与关节限位</td>\n<td>目标可达性差，跨步失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用简化模型判据直接下发关节</td>\n<td>跳过全身动量分配</td>\n<td>手臂/躯干动量反噬，姿态失稳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些误用的共同根源是<strong>把判据当控制指令</strong>。判据的本职是评价与约束——它回答&quot;这样会不会倒&quot;，不回答&quot;关节该出多大力&quot;。越过这层分工，就会用错误的自由度去满足一个正确的判据。正确的做法是让判据充当优化里的约束或代价项（见 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a>），由优化在完整自由度上求解可行动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>平衡是持续把倾覆趋势纠回，而非静止站住；判据回答&quot;会不会倒到不可挽回&quot;。</li>\n<li>静态判据看重心投影是否在支撑多边形内，高速时必须升级到考虑动力学的判据。</li>\n<li>ZMP 是双足平地行走的经典标尺，要求维持运动所需的压力中心落在脚底支撑区内。</li>\n<li>LIP 把整机简化为恒高倒立摆，导出捕获点，把&quot;会不会倒&quot;转成&quot;该把脚放哪&quot;。</li>\n<li>现代平衡转向全身动量视角，在摩擦锥约束下规划动量轨迹，统一描述含腾空相的动作。</li>\n<li>平衡判据是模型控制与学习控制共同的评价标尺，决定动作的安全边界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平衡与动态稳定","id":"平衡与动态稳定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"零力矩点：双足平衡的经典标尺","id":"零力矩点-双足平衡的经典标尺"},{"level":2,"text":"线性倒立摆与捕获点","id":"线性倒立摆与捕获点"},{"level":2,"text":"从简化模型到全身动量","id":"从简化模型到全身动量"},{"level":2,"text":"判据选择的常见反模式","id":"判据选择的常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"腿足机构与步态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/leg-mechanisms-gait"},"next":{"title":"双足与四足控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/biped-quadruped-control"}}